        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Mathiu 25 pari khou dinlou e,",
            "Bang ganthum khou kaipou )_3 talent njan lou;",
            "Gankhat khang 5, gankhat khang 2,",
            "Gankhat khang 1 njan lou e.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Ai tatna guang datni nangniu guaita jao khang,",
            "Njan loumei khou )_3 nbuna tan bam o;",
            "Tuna kaipou )_3 mei kathui khou din lou.",
            "",
            "2. Kaipou )_3 guang datna talent khuam kariu the,",
            "Mei kathui khou kaipou )_3 lummei sukan the;",
            "Akhat pangmei putei gang guang mak khuan e,",
            "Kaipou )_3 kasuan guai la gan the.",
            "",
            "3. Kaipou )_3 nang khang ni talent njan lou the,",
            "Kaipou khang kungmei bumang guaita laguang khang;",
            "Neila khang nang tat patna katanh tan o,",
            "Panti nnai san tat patna tan o."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
